d 'TSPMED': module to perform causal mediation analysis for time series with one or more mediators
d
d  tspmed is a Stata command for causal mediation analysis using
d time-series data. It accommodates one or more mediators and
d supports OLS-HAC, ARDL, FMOLS, DOLS and DML estimators, with
d joint HAC inference and residual diagnostics. 
d
d KW: causal mediation
d KW: time series
d
d Requires: Stata version 14
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261114
d
d Author:  Yusuf Toyin Yusuf,  Kwara State University
d Support: email  YUSUF.YUSUF@@KWASU.EDU.NG
d
d Author: Francis Baidoo, Koforidua Technical University
d Support: email ytoyinyusuf@@gmail.com
d
f tspmed.ado
f tspmed.sthlp
f tspmed_cert_coint.dta
f tspmed_cert_stationary.dta
f tspmed_cert.do
